{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالتِّينِ","d":"wal-tīni","e":"By the fig"},{"c":"وَالزَّيْتُونِ","d":"wal-zaytūni","e":"and the olive"}],"a":{"g":"By the fig and the olive"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَطُورِ","d":"waṭūri","e":"And (the) Mount"},{"c":"سِينِينَ","d":"sīnīna","e":"Sinai"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] Mount Sinai"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَهَذَا","d":"wahādhā","e":"And this"},{"c":"الْبَلَدِ","d":"l-baladi","e":"[the] city"},{"c":"الْأَمِينِ","d":"l-amīni","e":"[the] secure"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] this secure city [Makkah],"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"لَقَدْ","d":"laqad","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We created"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانَ","d":"l-insāna","e":"man"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"أَحْسَنِ","d":"aḥsani","e":"(the) best"},{"c":"تَقْوِيمٍ","d":"taqwīmin","e":"mould"}],"a":{"g":"We have certainly created man in the best of stature;"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"رَدَدْنَاهُ","d":"radadnāhu","e":"We return him"},{"c":"أَسْفَلَ","d":"asfala","e":"(to the) lowest"},{"c":"سَافِلِينَ","d":"sāfilīna","e":"(of the) low"}],"a":{"g":"Then We return him to the lowest of the low,"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"وَعَمِلُوا","d":"waʿamilū","e":"and do"},{"c":"الصَّالِحَاتِ","d":"l-ṣāliḥāti","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"فَلَهُمْ","d":"falahum","e":"then for them"},{"c":"أَجْرٌ","d":"ajrun","e":"(is a) reward"},{"c":"غَيْرُ","d":"ghayru","e":"never"},{"c":"مَمْنُونٍ","d":"mamnūnin","e":"ending"}],"a":{"g":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds, for they will have a reward uninterrupted."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"Then what"},{"c":"يُكَذِّبُكَ","d":"yukadhibuka","e":"causes you to deny"},{"c":"بَعْدُ","d":"baʿdu","e":"after (this)"},{"c":"بِالدِّينِ","d":"bil-dīni","e":"the judgment"}],"a":{"g":"So what yet causes you to deny the Recompense?"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَيْسَ","d":"alaysa","e":"Is not"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"بِأَحْكَمِ","d":"bi-aḥkami","e":"(the) Most Just"},{"c":"الْحَاكِمِينَ","d":"l-ḥākimīna","e":"(of) the Judges"}],"a":{"g":"Is not Allah the most just of judges?"}}}